    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#9$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Shelly is dead.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1839_1#3$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1838_1#3$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1838_1#3$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "What?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Michael"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1839_1#3$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "First Dalton, now Shelly... What's going on here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I said, Shelly is dead.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1839_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1838_1#3$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's with that tone?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marion"
    },
    {
        "text": "Anyway, thanks for coming to inform us that another accident occurred. We're shocked too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The last person she met before she died was Michael.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1838_1#2$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1839_1#6$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Michael"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1839_1#5$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't make baseless accusations, Tip.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marion"
    },
    {
        "text": "She was watching movies with you and Moira. I heard all about it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Exactly. She was with us, but left partway through after she got a message. Molly and I didn't ask, and we didn't go with her. But maybe we should have...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Which is why we need to find out exactly what happened. So I asked around, and\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Someone saw her with you at the studio near the warehouse!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1838_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1839_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I just bumped into her!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Michael"
    },
    {
        "text": "She looked distracted. I thought she must've been feeling guilty about interrupting the shoot, so I offered to comfort her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Michael"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1838_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "How was I supposed to know she would take her own life?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Michael"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1839_1#5$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "<i>Comfort</i> her? In an empty studio? Just the two of you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1838_1#3$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Come on, babe, you know you're the only girl for me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Michael"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1839_1#5$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just shut up already!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1839_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "So did you really kill Shelly?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_warehouse",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1844_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Two accidents in as many days?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Camera Assistant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1846_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "And not just accidents, fatalities. Of all the film crews in Wrankwood, how'd I end up in <i>this</i> one? Just my rotten luck...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Unlucky Stagehand"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1844_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, come on. You blame your luck whenever a can of paint gets spilled, whenever a shadow dashes across the studio door, even when the intercity net has a bad signal.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Camera Assistant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1844_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, I say this is our big break! Do you even realize how much the tabloids will pay for a firsthand account from a witness?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Camera Assistant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1844_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now if you'll excuse me, I need to go make sure I remember every last detail of Shelly's corpse.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Camera Assistant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1846_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ugh, could you not? And we still have work to do on set.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Unlucky Stagehand"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1844_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You go first, Hautin. I have notes to take!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Camera Assistant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1846_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Unlucky Stagehand"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1844_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_penrustle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Abner said Shelly's been out of sorts for a while now. Did the shock of Dalton's death drive her to suicide?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Camera Assistant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1844_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sounds plausible, but it's not much of a story.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Camera Assistant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1844_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "If there's more to it than meets the eye... then I wouldn't have to worry about rent for half a year. Why should I be holding up mics just to make ends meet?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Camera Assistant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1844_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Camera Assistant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1844_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Didn't the medical team say she died of hypothermia? Then what's with all these wounds on her left palm?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Camera Assistant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1844_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yikes, that's creepy. Is it some kind of occult ritual?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Camera Assistant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not a ritual, but the sign of a struggle against herself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1844_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Struggle?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Camera Assistant"
    },
    {
        "text": "Isn't everyone saying she walked into the cold storage from stress? Could there really be a dark secret to this...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Camera Assistant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.2,
        "xstrength": 20,
        "ystrength": 20,
        "vibrato": 20,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1844_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Whoa, Lucian! Where'd you come from? I didn't hear you at all!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Camera Assistant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1828_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "I suggested that she fight her hallucinations with pain.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "text": "She had been hearing echoes of the past, but wanted to finish her work and bring this movie to a satisfactory conclusion.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1828_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "She wouldn't have taken her own life out of despair. The self-inflicted wounds on her hand are proof of that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1828_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "This time, however, the pain was not enough for her to escape.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1844_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That stubborn, neurotic, and paranoid Shelly actually listened to you? Now <i>that's</i> hard to believe...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Camera Assistant"
    },
    {
        "text": "But it sounds like you knew her well, Lucian.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Camera Assistant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1828_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not especially.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
